## 8. Roadmap (next phase)

1. Google, Microsoft and phone (OTP) sign-in; profile settings; push notifications.
2. Fees and True Total Cost of Ownership, with the TCO filter and fee breakdown.
3. Compare up to 4 schools side by side.
4. Partner schools answer their own enquiries in the portal; the Kidscover Standard admission form and CRM webhook; outbound-click logging.
5. Arrival-time commute (from each school's start time) and dashboard tiles.
6. The reader in more languages (Marathi and Hindi facilities and achievements), and classes 11-12 as their own level.

## 9. Out of Scope for Now

- AI sentiment analysis of social media (Reddit and other unstructured sources); reviews stay first-party and moderated.
- Payment gateway for admission fees.
- Paid or copyrighted photo sources (e.g. Google Maps photos), by decision.
